478
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:56,014
<font color="#ffff00">Atau kau membawanya kembali pada kami?</font>

479
00:36:56,756 --> 00:36:58,303
<font color="#ffff00">Aku janji.</font>

480
00:37:00,051 --> 00:37:02,179
<font color="#ffff00">Aku akan membawanya kembali.</font>

481
00:37:03,638 --> 00:37:05,686
<font color="#ffff00">Kami akan melanjutkan misinya.</font>

482
00:37:51,728 --> 00:37:52,729
<font color="#ffff00">Rajaku!</font>

483
00:37:52,896 --> 00:37:54,648
<font color="#ffff00">Hentikan. Hentikan.</font>

484
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:59,823
<font color="#ffff00">Aku sudah mengirim sebuah
