489
00:38:12,499 --> 00:38:13,591
<font color="#ffff00">Ya.</font>

490
00:38:14,751 --> 00:38:15,798
<font color="#ffff00">Kami akan baik-baik saja.</font>

491
00:38:15,877 --> 00:38:17,800
<font color="#ffff00">Selain itu, kau akan di hubungi
saat kami butuh bantuan.</font>

492
00:38:17,962 --> 00:38:19,134
<font color="#ffff00">Yes!</font>

493
00:38:19,297 --> 00:38:21,675
<font color="#ffff00">Aku punya banyak hal untuk
