497
00:38:29,724 --> 00:38:31,067
<font color="#ffff00">Coba lihat ini.</font>

498
00:38:32,393 --> 00:38:35,397
<font color="#ffff00">Kendali jarak jauh manik-manik Kimoyo.</font>

499
00:38:35,563 --> 00:38:38,362
