506
00:38:53,206 --> 00:38:55,129
<font color="#ffff00">Ya, aku yakin para leluhur
menyukainya.</font>

507
00:38:56,376 --> 00:38:57,377
<font color="#ffff00">Cobalah mereka.</font>

508
00:39:01,464 --> 00:39:02,511
<font color="#ffff00">Sepenuhnya otomatis.</font>

509
00:39:02,924 --> 00:39:05,177
<font color="#ffff00">Seperti film Amerika kuno
yang biasa Ayah tonton.</font>

510
00:39:05,260 --> 00:39:06,261
<font color="#ffff00">Mmm.</font>

511
00:39:06,344 --> 00:39:08,517
<font color="#ffff00">Dan aku membuat mereka
