513
00:39:11,850 --> 00:39:13,602
<font color="#ffff00">Tebak aku menyebut mereka apa?</font>

514
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:15,145
<font color="#ffff00">Sepatu kets.</font>

515
00:39:16,980 --> 00:39:18,106
<font color="#ffff00">Karena kamu...</font>

516
00:39:18,273 --> 00:39:19,445
<font color="#ffff00">Lupakan.</font>

517
00:39:20,984 --> 00:39:22,327
<font color="#ffff00">Jika kau akan menghadapi Klaue,</font>

518
00:39:22,485 --> 00:39:26,661
<font color="#ffff00">Kau akan memerlukan kelompok
