519
00:39:26,823 --> 00:39:27,949
<font color="#ffff00">Bagan A.</font>

520
00:39:28,116 --> 00:39:29,663
<font color="#ffff00">- Desainku. /
- Tekhnologi lama.</font>

521
00:39:29,826 --> 00:39:32,079
<font color="#ffff00">- Lama? /
- Fungsional, tapi kuno.</font>

522
00:39:32,245 --> 00:39:33,918
<font color="#ffff00">"Hei, orang-orang menembakku.</font>

523
00:39:33,997 --> 00:39:35,965
<font color="#ffff00">Tunggu, biarkan aku memakai helmku. "</font>

524
00:39:36,124 --> 00:39:37,717
<font color="#ffff00">Cukup.</font>

525
00:39:38,793 --> 00:39:40,761
<font color="#ffff00">Sekarang, lihat ini.</font>

526
00:39:43,506 --> 00:39:44,723
<font color="#ffff00">Apa kau suka yang itu?</font>

527
00:39:44,883 --> 00:39:46,180
<font color="#ffff00">Menggoda.</font>

528
00:39:47,051 --> 00:39:49,395
<font color="#ffff00">Tapi idenya adalah untuk
