540
00:40:29,636 --> 00:40:30,683
<font color="#ffff00">Hei...</font>

541
00:40:30,762 --> 00:40:32,309
<font color="#ffff00">Tunggu sebentar.</font>

542
00:40:32,472 --> 00:40:35,191
<font color="#ffff00">Nanites menyerap energi kinetik...</font>

543
00:40:35,350 --> 00:40:37,773
