546
00:40:44,776 --> 00:40:46,278
<font color="#ffff00">Kau sedang merekam?</font>

547
00:40:46,861 --> 00:40:48,613
<font color="#ffff00">Untuk tujuan penelitian.</font>

548
00:40:56,037 --> 00:40:57,254
<font color="#ffff00">Hapus rekaman itu.</font>

549
00:40:57,478 --> 00:41:02,055
<font color="#ffff00">Busan, Korea Selatan.</font>

550
00:41:17,684 --> 00:41:18,856
<font color="#ffff00">Lewat sini.</font>

551
00:41:21,854 --> 00:41:23,481
<font color="#ffff00">Bast semoga ini cepat berlalu...</font>

552
00:41:23,648 --> 00:41:26,652
<font color="#ffff00">Dan aku dapat mengeluarkan hal
