553
00:41:26,818 --> 00:41:30,038
<font color="#ffff00">Ini terlihat bagus.
geleng saja bolak-balik.</font>

554
00:41:30,196 --> 00:41:32,870
<font color="#ffff00">Apa? Ini memalukan.</font>

555
00:41:34,826 --> 00:41:36,499
<font color="#ffff00">Halo, Sophia.</font>

556
00:41:36,786 --> 00:41:39,005
<font color="#ffff00">Senang bertemu denganmu.</font>

557
00:41:40,289 --> 00:41:41,882
<font color="#ffff00">Siapa mereka berdua?</font>

558
