1282
01:36:18,189 --> 01:36:19,611
<font color="#ffff00">Kemuliaan bagi leluhur.</font>

1283
01:36:20,400 --> 01:36:22,118
<font color="#ffff00">Bangun, T'Challa.</font>

1284
